{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/S-XZm5CZOhgrVhDAHmOofQ?scene=1&click_id=10","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:03.949157+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/S-XZm5CZOhgrVhDAHmOofQ?scene=1&click_id=10","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>推免研究生</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9uvGnqic0e24wU7DxHH3fPQKaAjbuzJ7hCbFbqfhWZZILBQeeul5dkLVJ6GN80d6PQcdoCeW7lOLc38lVNxfOIs4U2g4MIBwvL5wl8GOQjVg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9uvGnqic0e263FUq0ec0K23OD2HGjrcDPH2PaaL0GJHP0VVu9K560ztH9YWyJNCts2ALsyokyKW8icLf9y8S3Pgoj25qXCZgRDjJic6ElsssEk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>2026年5月，经2026年5月20日学校十一届第97次党委常委会研究决定，天津大学决定成立“天津大学集成电路学部”、并同步成立“天津大学纳电子科学与芯片工程学院”旨在聚焦低维电子材料与先进芯片工艺领域，对接国家 “强芯” 战略，培养拔尖创新人才。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9uvGnqic0e241RAI7MGFEAkJd7eOOYLO1Qj0OWpHJhfWc8eIkia6cYuRibj6vic2FcluHyE0xIQTXWNE5UE7NUEapVlBTxJOQXSR5icCVP2QUJ7g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>天津大学纳电子科学与芯片工程学院本年度推免招生工作现已正式启动，主要招收专业包括：电子科学与技术、材料学、仪器科学与技术、化学、物理、电子信息、材料与化工等。欢迎相关及相近专业学生积极登记并与我们取得联系。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/9uvGnqic0e27MVyR1XmHRIQJYuy678MDa8QTGBL1libjKVWD8Pvu2YTy4yGAXueGibcsjo1mn2JibYPeDslWox6ESJ7cDmuC3F4onLGr4FYRYLA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>有机会获得所在学校遴选推免资格的考生，均可通过以下共享文档二维码进行登记，并于我校推免复试系统开放后进行报名（预计本年度7月-9月中旬开放，天津大学研招网：https://yzb.tju.edu.cn/）。我们将提前与你取得联系，就中心夏令营、预推免等活动进行通知。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/9uvGnqic0e24cZ4Z7ukbQEx9DvPT4pzreFoChYAu4hGY82RI34FbEOC9UEkibibHwod2KZofUkQ6CVEiacGoWiaC9dd4emmqKQYjGFFr6LGZMpCI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>2027级天津大学纳电子科学与芯片工程学院推免招生意向信息收集表</span></p></section><section><p><span>https://docs.qq.</span></p><p><span><span>com</span></span><span><span>/</span></span><span><span>form/page/</span></span></p><p><span><span>DZkRaWWdJTkJ</span></span></p><p><span><span>mcWFX</span></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>对于参加预推免面试且最终完成录取的考生，学院将在校级学业奖学金（1000-7000元）、院级优秀学生奖学金（500-3000元/人）评优基础上，根据推免生源的本科成绩、学校层次及工作表现等因素，额外授予推免新生雏鹰奖学金（1000-3000元/人），以资鼓励。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/9uvGnqic0e27rwRpGzVjJTudGlsRicdNzasGrrsB5I1kkj4icicZnJdRdl9iciaYoQTRX0CxkLn9YzkwBFalfu07SIcg0KVhc8ajotKEic4e8xpjxA/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>一、基本简介</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/9uvGnqic0e25ibFQkggnon3IJMR6AfuK9pic7SqRNcbmz4DGWlnx8JoiaZf3RWYRJnqddxtl2lgibvPAX4hs3QylbfibAfgU1SUKqok4GAtgm5DgY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/9uvGnqic0e24XaBpdrQsibaaaR090Su6tAwvWb4bZFD0Lrfo81v4Ew0WVib8iaNDAGYVWVeuhm39icQENlcHfibftVjaB2zreX4ZKiaj7lmVY1n0UI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>天津大学纳电子科学与芯片工程学院（下称 ：“芯片学院”），由天津大学天津纳米颗粒与纳米系统国际研究中心（下称 ：“纳米中心”）牵头筹建，于 2026 年 5 月 20 日正式获批设立。学院整合校内科研平台、市级重点实验室、海河实验室及高新科技成果转化企业，搭建起贯通基础研究、技术孵化、产业落地的全链条创新生态。依托一体化平台优势，学院打造多元化发展路径，助力学子成长为科研人才、工程技术骨干与创新创业人才。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>NO.01  </span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/9uvGnqic0e25qnCARdoE2H3UvMrK2YlJwjlTkfevwjGywmb8p0ool9PncyRDqg4NaT6UBHhw5Qg8kUjmunbF6LRib3OoicDVnoEleibiaGnticZgA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>天津大学</span></p><p><span>（Tianjin University）</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>天津大学（Tianjin University）肇始于 1895 年 10 月 2 日，前身是北洋大学，作为中国第一所现代大学，开创了我国近代高等教育的先河。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>百余年来，学校始终坚守 “兴学强国” 使命，恪守 “实事求是” 校训，传承 “严谨治学” 校风、“爱国奉献” 传统与 “矢志创新” 追求，深耕育人与科研沃土，为国家经济社会发展作出突出贡献，累计培养三十余万高层次人才。1951 年，北洋大学与河北工学院合并，定名天津大学；1959 年入选全国首批重点大学。步入新时代，学校先后成为国家 “211 工程”“985 工程” 首批重点建设高校，亦是国家 “世界一流大学建设” A 类高校。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/9uvGnqic0e27MImlyCJScLfbE37ibjVwvty3MaUibUhOdy7vTsOeCEHIL5mhZsONqYGXZS8dq1SPL0HW1IaTs9Jv2y1lsS66icIThSZ5jZILicD0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/9uvGnqic0e26FrxezEWkHeBiaIOVKPUhXObOicianv0E5hhLyztyxibQoPCbhShNb9icpFf8OBFK4hpesVhcibL6aicZ845HxcrpbQX8rKia9eHThKWo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>NO.02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9uvGnqic0e24lzUhCnMWpm2g71CnhK4vHGJTDHqH7Iic2InNpHHRS0cuZDH3DPpgYUFU3VZ6tGsFWdY4XagyAD98IV4MCsoCtiaLwL2VqPKXkc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>天津大学天津纳米颗粒与纳米系统国际研究中心</span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>天津大学纳米颗粒与纳米系统国际研究中心于 2018 年 7 月 22 日，在卫津路校区第二十号教学楼西配楼正式揭牌成立。</span></p><p><span>中心长期深耕石墨烯电子学、团簇物理学、能源材料化学等前沿方向，现已建成规模完备的综合科研平台：拥有科研用房 4000 余平方米，各类精密科研设备 400 余台套，累计到位科研经费超 2 亿元。成立至今，中心已累计培养研究生 150 余名。毕业生大多入职集成电路、高端仪器、新能源等战略性新兴产业企业，或进入科研院所、高等院校从事科研工作。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9uvGnqic0e27kkdz4hwGaibG5Xp61xf18ehH6LglO4OVfpxfibFp93iaW6LibMXs2LkMwgeE4BiaNYDvBKn7xa7dx6dquSlYfeOvVRUaIt4M3ANa0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>米</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>纳</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9uvGnqic0e26GndsicppgzkH3mfmpOkNJY41HYOut3diaqjRYLyMWIOj2FnurqwkKO2QcPaKFG2aOjJ1jntCvZPSdp3OcibJ5xkbLovgL0kXqvU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>NO.03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/9uvGnqic0e24wp2DBT6wHfFEDwfLvpD04iadjRZX0JRq25DrzjrD3OCibPnicKuB2ibgDozySFYN2veHgseREs15MPQKU3EtlkicJ7vc8f2oF0auo/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>天津市低维电子材料及</span></p><p><span>先进表征仪器研发重点</span></p><p><span>实验室</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>2023 年 12 月，中心获批筹建天津市低维电子材料及先进表征仪器研发重点实验室，该实验室于 2026 年 1 月 5 日顺利通过验收。</span></p><p><span>实验室整合校内优势科研力量，以石墨烯、团簇等低维电子材料为主要研究对象，开展材料在传感器、新能源领域的基础研究与成果转化，同时攻关高端表征仪器的自主研发与技术迭代。实验室着力打造集技术研发、成果转化、平台运维、人才培养、检测服务于一体的综合创新平台，贯通科研与产业应用全链条，构建起以先进电子材料、精密表征仪器研发为核心的特色创新体系。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section></section><section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/9uvGnqic0e26ZZrdh07ibI0RGoWvibIz5O2rl2U55oS6nFwU2Nh11VzXeBuHVViciasYcGPFJFYibGoXASm4icGw9ib5uzaqVfC1bHE2p1nPpDCXyJY/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/9uvGnqic0e26zAEq56eXg9Bxt8t34CRzlwvauEWlYg79W95IcytAHvbmiamvVvWbSKniaxAUQT3liczstibndQJKiaqubzMGYTYQRL2JtCOtdW4Go/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>NO.04  </span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/9uvGnqic0e27iaicicHxGLKosmv3UnjdicQZwt3yILov2VcfJISSpzEOOMJqO0ibsqxSgVJt9TY3kReZU7FUdyZHnqK9N8UP9mhJJ5zAaxXGwWrzc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>天津市低维电子材料</span></p><p><span>海河实验室</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2024 年 5 月，纳米中心团队牵头启动天津市低维电子材料海河实验室筹建工作。在天津市科技局、市教委等部门的统筹协调与大力支持下，该实验室于同年 10 月 17 日获市政府正式批复立项。实验室落户河西区，当地配套充足的实验场地、人才公寓及生活服务设施，为平台建设运营筑牢基础。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/9uvGnqic0e24XJMypjLBBV0HlNicKFlL0sEzOEGRmUmM7PICdkZtQiaLiaMY9GdiafDzLv12PqE7pPo2mr7Qbe2pDDNItclyxa9j9sF2DNWeiaoLI/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>实验室聚焦下一代先进制造所需的新型低维电子材料与器件、集成电路加工技术、高端科研仪器装备研制等方向，重点攻克行业关键核心技术难题，布局集成电路未来新赛道，为国家重大战略任务落地提供坚实科技支撑。实验室主要研究领域分为五大方向：晶圆级低维电子材料规模化制备（以石墨烯为代表）、碳基器件等低维材料微纳加工技术、高端科学仪器装备研发制造、低功耗高集成度气体传感器开发，以及纳米毒理学与纳米药物研究。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9uvGnqic0e24u37JRPK8XpicNOzsN8LHmfhJ6PIicIlPstEQQZ4yuFlavCkSSMpZspw7UQvNx8TazXYmprchfZZyOfpsbDQYkAyTuKkkQcIgXI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/9uvGnqic0e24ibicZf3vb9iaNyB4sia1emIWeeACGz0QPI6vCutWcbNibicf8dt1UUibcAeToCHvezlKeSDibpInC9OvIyf92OrdsMpRsOiceKjeB4xO8/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二、研究方向</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9uvGnqic0e25z8fTPjvk2YWolC6A6dTtoqSibZEqrcagrOBQkOVFaK84dGoDibqzYBopdp0fwlfSosJUPb1RvdqpcDEaic8ICayggna7QsCqgmo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9uvGnqic0e274R459C9eicNuvgCPXmcJkic9F5QKpYCVFSicz2vMGUGaIlXDhEqAN59AjGKn6aMsXWib84omcad7pIUqcjDiaKDD9980E5T88q43E/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>NO.01  </span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>               团簇物理与化学方向   </span></p><p><span>本学院致力于研制最为先进的高精度质谱与光电子能谱仪、基于角分辨光电子谱的储存环及原子级分辨的团簇质量选择沉积系统等具有自主知识产权的大型设备及核心部件，寻找并揭示团簇性质转变和其他相关现象背后的物理和化学机制。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9uvGnqic0e26umTawvYoZMUEOarv7InPjOCEatJXA6zNVL0oKcicbicibViadC2ywfjmqsgUWGSLG9tS8mT2fL3bO9M8zgfvC2lVlEMxR6g0WKZU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9uvGnqic0e24u1ia0wGZGpV4X9Vqyyg2MRX0dYqrbsRjNc7O72rmrjnqs0c8EUTgJMPBZ2ibEmrLBnwSHLzcZt9Qf9t8rL10Mc08xjD70L7odE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/9uvGnqic0e25E00vH4XgAtn31dwbxzMVBJOriaDzc8uCIjWMbejhbFTbZPNfNOQof4cMDynFr0YcAuP23nGVIUIG8Nch0J4LxC1cTiaib00eeGY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>NO.02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>              石墨烯电子学及器件物理</span></p><p><span>本学院是全球目前唯一可实现碳化硅全晶面切割、研磨、抛光（含 CMP 工艺与配套配方），并完成原子级超平滑表面制备、全域单层石墨烯生长全流程工艺研发与应用的机构。学院重点围绕外延石墨烯及各类低维凝聚态材料，开展基础理化机理研究，并推进低维材料功能器件的开发工作。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/9uvGnqic0e27Xe7cjscys8ReDbCC6Q92PUYZmh76MmOQhTQHL5NibAkJuX6pt9zvwpdxpic85VcFFaichYorEKK8zP2fy0jgYc97NY8MgWyyjEI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9uvGnqic0e27zBoOH0r9IURx2j8qUlqSk2c2oLpyTffxxelSCiadNxKbJCOs4SIa9Zic4EYmhCPyzNcKpNfrCyNAlYl5J0icuWwsqhKMkxQ7zwE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>NO.03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><span>                  能源材料与化学</span></p><p><span>本学院深耕可持续能源领域前沿研究，重点开展多项核心课题：探索多维操控工具的创新研发方法，解析飞秒时间、亚纳米空间尺度下光催化过程的内在物理机理，研制生物质基大体积柔性可穿戴超级电容器，开发可直接应用于海水制氢的一体化光解水设备，同时依托人工智能算法，实现储能器件与材料的性能精准预测。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/9uvGnqic0e27bUJEKVMZhraweXiclf60GdtX3rDJQIE6m8ILR2IGFbicEdWwlpJ7y4klggrOvNQj0Ik7Wu8uM0httIkcGnJgiaq0mFVzEDw9ibibs/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9uvGnqic0e25Yiav4jWQUm693Q4dbzq3yXOsTWjz3pCkuMwveN99VyBVmwzo1tAEKfdwWicRytkK5PrV2YtBQjlWeuXfcVfGia23ibh3wicIA6ibqc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/9uvGnqic0e26KhsrIebGV9Zh4HuMQnXWfd9zsVID86LtDTBkdkL4gbsiajWwrh8qobutI8ERwQPce36nttTub3ibFz8TIjLwNQjFRzQZhZ43HQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>三、设施条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9uvGnqic0e26F9icBiaMjf6wG9qzow5IvavWN9YeIz0pp71OVCxtwDXEAqrATgv4smIPX8oTBOUiaaJCAnt8wSruZRnQtZneNXbGablbawFqRwc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9uvGnqic0e26RicfiaxPGafsPY990vwyC1Gk4aiax3n8U3N5zprbHe9AvBrvYsTv08ZoJGgYyJlpSDh5iaNALyLiaP7fhBotxQfwEicqPNSWIBk1D4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>中心科研用房总面积逾 3500 平方米，其中 2025 年新建科研场地达 2800 平方米；低维电子材料海河实验室科研用房面积约 4800 平方米。双方现有各类科研设备 400 余台套，设备总价值超 2 亿元人民币。平台配备全套半导体薄膜生长、工艺加工与精密测试表征仪器，涵盖低温扫描隧道显微镜、扫描电子显微镜、原子力显微镜、电子束 / 热蒸发金属蒸镀系统、原子层沉积系统、反应离子刻蚀系统、低温强磁系统、大尺寸激光直写仪、X 射线光电子能谱仪、聚焦离子束双束显微镜等高端设备。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/9uvGnqic0e24icnDwFWoCPFvO5OuOP65JiaBa3IqKO4rxOk884p1bumahLELfnG8GMnibzwtRAXuSktcymXDOHSUvAicCY7ugG7CmZ0ibpAPVZ1Ho/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/9uvGnqic0e25vamiaYxVZw7Q2dAxH7h247RHsNhUzn1uDsuTuFcHY5Kd2pwufyYu6Yd9vKqd4qYLU50UP8toNJQ7zcYYhB6JfCn6ybhQAkLoY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>左右滑动查看更多</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>此外，中心自建机械加工平台与高性能计算中心，可全面满足各类零部件加工及科研算力需求。目前计算业务已覆盖电催化、团簇研究、有限元仿真、机器学习、荧光与磷光分析等多个方向，为实验室基础研究提供有力支撑。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/9uvGnqic0e25KQu4o3137ZG5UPhGrRS7Lc70cuEXV6ia2XHbFBNqjibbe6OJP8Q7gRNhUZmL8RqvFfBVc8xVcMfeeMLjaNJWqWBbedPqdrzPibg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/9uvGnqic0e26dmuSPicrLpEbwkXFaH20uCbIu7yv7kZEg5d8WLUIwibTcBgtMRrvSwo